# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit: credentials and local state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .auth.json is the Playwright session for the live app (tools/crawl.cjs).
# .vercel/ holds per-machine Vercel project links.
# shots/ is the default output of tools/shot.js.
.auth.json
.env*
.vercel/
.DS_Store
node_modules/
shots/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit: build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dist/ is produced by tools/build-dist.sh. It is a copy of the tree, so a
# committed copy would only go stale.
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit: live customer data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is public. audit/ was captured from the client's production
# account and carries real customer names, phone numbers, email addresses,
# share tokens and a workspace API key. See "What is not in this repository"
# in README.md before changing these lines.
audit/
WhatsApp Image *.jpeg
